---
import { personalInfo } from "../data/portfolioData";
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="reveal mb-10 md:mb-14">
      <span class="kicker-chip">02 / About</span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight text-paper uppercase -skew-x-6">
        Who's behind it
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="reveal relative">
        <span class="absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-full h-full bg-signal clip-diagonal" />
        <div class="relative clip-diagonal bg-paper p-10 md:p-14 flex items-center justify-center select-none">
          <span class="font-display text-7xl md:text-8xl tracking-tight text-ink uppercase">
            SX
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="text-base leading-[1.55] text-paper/80">
          {personalInfo.description}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-[1.55] text-paper/80">
          Most of my projects start as <span class="font-accent text-signal">bad ideas</span>
          that get too much effort. Games, tools, bots, dashboards — if it
          scratches an itch or looks fun, I'll probably build it.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-[1.55] text-paper/80">
          Right now I'm into Go, Kotlin, and anything that ships fast.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>